Selected tcsh 6.24.16 source files from the upstream release.
The upstream notices are retained, including Copyright.

Source: https://astron.com/pub/tcsh/tcsh-6.24.16.tar.gz
SHA-256: 4208cf4630fb64d91d81987f854f9570a5a0e8a001a92827def37d0ed8f37364

Belka's build configuration and platform definitions live in
usr/lib/compat/tcsh. mk/userland.mk builds the shell against mlibc and
the NetBSD terminfo compatibility library.

The sh.proc.c wait4 selection also accepts HAVE_WAIT4. Belka selects
this path because mlibc's wait3 discards resource accounting while wait4
supports the waitsys accounting interface. Local sessions are configured
without REMOTEHOST lookup.

NOTICE collects the source redistribution notices for the root image.
